      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Sorry, what was I saying, it just comes and goes. Maybe a four out of ten on a bad day. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know.",
